      "translation_input": "Le 18 octobre 2025, une tempête de poussière a réduit la production solaire de 34 % en quinze minutes. La température de l'armoire de batteries a augmenté de 8 °C. tandis que le ventilateur de l'onduleur produisait une vibration anormale Au lieu d'arrêter la station. le système a coupé le chauffage secondaire, réduit certains éclairages et démarré le groupe de secours. Il a identifié trois causes possibles des débris sur les panneaux, un roulement usé et une résistance croissante dans un connecteur de batterie Après la tempête, une caméra portée sur la tête a lu.les plaques et les codes d'alarme, puis un processeur local les a comparés au manuel hors ligne Aucune image sensible n'a été envoyée dans le nuage Le",
      "translated_text": "On October 18, 2025, a dust storm reduced solar output by 34 percent in fifteen minutes. The temperature of the battery compartment has risen by 8°C. While the inverter fan was producing an abnormal vibration instead of shutting down the station. The system turned off the secondary heating, reduced some of the lights and started the rescue group. He identified three possible causes of the debris on the panels, a worn bearing and increasing resistance in a battery connector. After the storm, a head-worn camera read the license plates and alarm codes, then a local processor compared them to the offline manual.",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "spoken_text": "On October 18, 2025, a dust storm reduced solar output by 34 percent in fifteen minutes. The temperature of the battery compartment has risen by 8°C. While the inverter fan was producing an abnormal vibration instead of shutting down the station. The system turned off the secondary heating, reduced some of the lights and started the rescue group. He identified three possible causes of the debris on the panels, a worn bearing and increasing resistance in a battery connector. After the storm, a head-worn camera read the license plates and alarm codes, then a local processor compared them to the offline manual.",
